  "answer": "This has been reported before, and there is no fix yet. PowerToys#47694 asks for the Power Display flyout to open next to its systray icon instead of a hardcoded bottom-right position. A PowerToys maintainer replied that bottom-right placement is by design, so it is being treated as a feature request. PowerToys#23857 asked the same for the Quick Access flyout back in 2023. It was closed as a duplicate of #23772, with a hotfix planned at the time, but your report shows the flyout still opens at bottom-right with the taskbar moved. PowerToys#47537 is related but weaker: a user asked for top-right placement for a top taskbar, and the centered flyout there was caused by a Windhawk mod. For now the flyouts stay at the bottom right of the screen. You can add a thumbs-up or your vertical-taskbar use case to #47694 to help prioritize it."
 },
